    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d237-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d237-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Security Council, Nixon Intelligence Files, Subject Files,
                    Chile, Minutes of 40 Committee. Secret; Eyes Only. Drafted on July 8. A copy was
                    sent to Mitchell, Packard, Johnson, Moorer, and Helms.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d237-f2" n="2" xml:id="d237-f2-content">
                <p>The Christian Democratic Party candidate won a close-fought election against the
                    UP candidate on July 18. (Ibid., Chile, 1971–1972)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
